未随仓库分发的逐帧完整追踪结果（29 段约 75 MB）与原始录像（约 13 GB）适用同一许可，
可向作者索取；由原始录像重建逐帧结果的完整命令见 tracking/reproduce_29.sh。
（The source code is released under the MIT License below; the data shipped with this
repository — including the 29 analysis-window trajectories under data/tracking_windows/ —
the fabrication drawings, and the apparatus BOM are released under CC BY 4.0. The full
per-frame tracking output (~75 MB) and the raw footage (~13 GB) are not distributed with
the repository but are available from the authors under the same licence; see
tracking/reproduce_29.sh to rebuild the per-frame output from the raw footage.）

